2. COMMERCIAL USE RESTRICTION & REVENUE THRESHOLD
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Commercial usage of the Software by any company, business entity, or individual 
that exceeds either of the following financial thresholds:

  a) Generating more than $200,000 USD in annual gross revenue; OR
