3. COMMERCIAL ROYALTIES & LICENSING TERMS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
For any commercial entity that exceeds the $200,000 threshold defined in Section 2:

  - Maximum Royalty Cap: The maximum payable royalty shall not exceed 1.0% of 
    total gross sales/revenue generated by products integrating or relying on 
    the Software.
  - Minimum Floor Rate: The minimum agreed-upon rate shall not be lower than 
    0.5% of total gross sales upon entering a commercial license agreement.

